The Velvet Mark is a self-described coalition of gentlemen who ensure that the right people manage the right parts of the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Masque District/index|Masque District]]. Its business is the money that moves through the district's casinos and bars, and the people who are paid for its services are not always asked first. [[Org/Velvet Mark/People/Father Marone|Father Marone]] is its concierge.

The Mark keeps a car for its crews that is a known asset but otherwise clean. Its members are known to the law as affiliates, though the Mark itself is not wanted for anything.

Its members wear ravens of the [[Iridescent Host|Host]]. The Mark buys stolen vehicles, meeting sellers in out-of-the-way places like an abandoned parking lot in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]]; it has paid the Party 3,200 gold for a minivan. Its people hand out cards for the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Masque District/Crystal Globe|Crystal Globe]] to those they want to see again, with word to say Cosimo sent them.
